   "refPoint": "TP6",
   "nominal": -0.2,
   "tolerance": 0.1,
   "unit": "V",
   "condition": "0 V standby",
   "source": "§5-19 step 4 (step 4)",
   "note": "Published as -0.1 V to -0.3 V. The companion to VR4, clamped through R66. As above, a failure here points at the HV DC output series pass and current limit circuit on the High Voltage/High Current assembly (A15), not at A14.",
